'''Curse''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2022 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. There are two sections of orange and black on its blade, with dark brown markings and symbols on them. The guard is bright orange and the handle is black with a wisp of orange near the top. 

